WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:41.333
One day Tom walked around the palace.

2
00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:46.557
Cat was hiding in his pocket.

3
00:00:46.558 --> 00:00:50.692
"I love being the royal wizard," Tom said.

4
00:00:50.693 --> 00:00:53.675
"I love the palace too," Cat said.

5
00:00:53.676 --> 00:00:55.928
"There are lots of mice.

6
00:00:55.929 --> 00:00:58.628
And Cook gives me treats."

7
00:00:58.629 --> 00:01:05.885
"Too bad you make the queen sneeze," Tom said.

8
00:01:05.886 --> 00:01:14.451
Just then Tom spotted the royal carriage.

9
00:01:14.452 --> 00:01:17.864
The royal family was going on a trip.

10
00:01:17.865 --> 00:01:23.760
Tom went to say good-bye.

11
00:01:23.761 --> 00:01:26.919
The king and queen waved to everyone.

12
00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.663
"Good-bye!" called the queen.

13
00:01:29.664 --> 00:01:35.388
"See you in two days," said the king.

14
00:01:35.389 --> 00:01:44.719
Dirk was carrying a trunk.

15
00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:47.862
He bumped into Tom hard.

16
00:01:47.863 --> 00:01:50.867
"I'm going with them," Dirk whispered.

17
00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:53.877
"But when I come back . . ."

18
00:01:53.878 --> 00:01:55.801
Tom gulped.

19
00:01:55.802 --> 00:02:04.037
"I'm going to tell everyone about that cat!"

20
00:02:04.038 --> 00:02:07.325
Dirk put his trunk on a big pile.

21
00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:15.242
Then he climbed into the carriage.

22
00:02:15.243 --> 00:02:19.142
"Dirk wants to get rid of me," Tom thought.

23
00:02:19.143 --> 00:02:22.498
"This time his plan is going to work.

24
00:02:22.499 --> 00:02:28.171
What am I going to do?"

25
00:02:28.172 --> 00:02:36.322
Soon the carriage was gone.

26
00:02:36.323 --> 00:02:39.856
The servants were happy.

27
00:02:39.857 --> 00:02:43.437
"We still have our work," said Cook.

28
00:02:43.438 --> 00:02:46.744
"But we can have fun too!"

29
00:02:46.745 --> 00:02:50.032
"Let's have a picnic," Gardener said.

30
00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:55.218
"Let's take a nap," the stable boy said.

31
00:02:55.219 --> 00:03:06.998
Tom walked away.

32
00:03:06.999 --> 00:03:09.649
"Cat," he whispered.

33
00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:18.021
"We have to stop Dirk!"
